    ("manual/theme.css", '''/* Theme of this manual, loaded AFTER the Lab64 base theme "c64" (/lab64/containers/pdf-gen/themes/c64.css: page, colours, cover, titles,
   tables, figures, notes, keys). Change its variables here, add rules for your own elements, or replace whole rules.
   C64_MANUAL_BASE="none" in lab64.env drops the base theme (this file is then the whole style). Examples: */
